# Shared by both Dockerfiles in this repo now that they use the same root context:
# Dockerfile.multistage needs src/, public/, *.config.* etc. as build INPUT; Dockerfile (the
# artifact-based one) needs dist/ as build input instead — so neither of those can be excluded
# here. Only exclude what genuinely never matters to either.
.git/
node_modules/
ares-docs/node_modules/
ares-docs/build/
ares-docs/.docusaurus/
*.md
.env*
